I couldn't find the answer in the AI Index after several searches. It describes the `Data Management Delete Job` form (`sys_dm_delete`) and says the form has a Condition builder. It doesn't name the buttons in that builder besides `AND` and `OR`.

The closest thing the index has is the button list for the list-view filter builder, which is a different screen. It includes 'Run filter', 'Add Sort' and 'Remove condition'. I won't assume the Delete Job form uses the same two buttons.

